	(text "POWER: 2 x LiPo pouch (~4 x 20 x 80 mm, ~600 mAh each, own protection PCBs) in parallel on J1 / J2 -> VBAT.\nVBAT goes to the XIAO's underside BAT+ pad: the XIAO charges the cells from its USB-C and makes 3V3.\nVBAT_SENSE = VBAT / 2 (R1/R2) -> D0. VBUS_SENSE = 5V pin x 0.6 (R3/R4) -> D1: USB present (the 5V pin floats on battery)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10.16 7.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0222cea2-163e-5581-ba92-458822e36402")
	)
	(text "MCU: XIAO ESP32C6, castellations + BAT pads reflowed flat (no sockets: the bar is ~11 mm thick).\nD0 VBAT_SENSE, D1 VBUS_SENSE, D2 BTN (LP GPIOs: ADC / deep-sleep wake), D3 LED data, D4/D5 I2C, D6 LED_EN\n(the XIAO sits on the bottom face, so this row faces the LEDs), D7 RGB_INT, D8 PROX_INT. D9/D10 spare. USB-C at the bar's side edge; antenna end copper-free."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10.16 101.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1b8eae92-a469-5307-930c-8e8471d416c5")
	)
	(text "SENSORS (I2C, 4.7k pull-ups R5/R6): APDS-9960 0x39 under the dome: IR reflectance proximity for fish near the surface,\nplus ambient light for 'tank is dim -> lights on'. IR LED (LEDA) on VBAT, LDR tied to LEDK.\nAPDS-9251 0x52 under the chrome oval: RGB + IR, reads the tank's colour while the LEDs flash white."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 203.2 7.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9867bc43-6644-51bf-8b38-b50acfabf503")
	)
	(text "LEDS: Q1 AO3401A high-side switch (R10 holds it off), driven by Q2 from LED_EN (R12 keeps it off at boot).\nVLED = VBAT 3.0-4.2 V: 3.3 V data meets the WS2812's 0.7 x VDD. Firmware stops the lights below VBAT 3.5 V.\n12 x WS2812B-2020, one per window square, 100 nF each. Keep LED data low while VLED is off."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 203.2 91.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c46cd2a2-3bba-500f-a513-6d7ff24bbc53")
	)
